  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "the-naked-director-s02e01-scene-07",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "出ろ、釈放だ  (Step Out, You're Released)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kawada": "川田",
    "muranishi": "村西",
    "police": "警察官"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "While Muranishi jokes about deluxe grilled eel in an interrogation room, Kawada visits a senior official with side-by-side photos of two sisters to prove they were tricked by a real license—and slips an envelope into his pocket.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "お忙しい中、いつもお時間頂きまして失礼しました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "実は困ったことがありまして、お力をお借りできないかと。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "この二人、姉妹なんですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "最近は小遣い欲しさに身分を偽る未成年も多い。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "ここまでそっくりな免許を持ってこられたら見分けがつきません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "こちらをポケットにしまっていただければ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "うな重を三つ特上でごちそういたしますよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "いらねえよ！嫌いなんだようなぎはよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "村西！出ろ、釈放だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "ちょっと待てよ、どういうことなんだよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "はいはい、お疲れさま。うな重キャンセル。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ご苦労さん。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "お忙しい中、いつもお時間頂きまして失礼しました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you for sparing your time when you are so busy.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "実は困ったことがありまして、お力をお借りできないかと。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We have run into trouble and hoped we might borrow your assistance.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "この二人、姉妹なんですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'These two girls are actually sisters.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "最近は小遣い欲しさに身分を偽る未成年も多い。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Lately many minors fake their age using an older sister's ID for pocket money.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "ここまでそっくりな免許を持ってこられたら見分けがつきません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When someone brings a license this identical, even we cannot tell them apart.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "こちらをポケットにしまっていただければ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you could simply tuck this envelope into your pocket.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "うな重を三つ特上でごちそういたしますよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let me treat the three of you to deluxe grilled eel boxes.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "いらねえよ！嫌いなんだようなぎはよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I don't want it! I hate eel anyway.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "村西！出ろ、釈放だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Muranishi! Step out, you are released.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "ちょっと待てよ、どういうことなんだよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hold on a second, what the heck is going on here!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "はいはい、お疲れさま。うな重キャンセル。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All right, good work, gentlemen. Cancel the eel boxes.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ご苦労さん。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thanks for your trouble.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
